      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Upload 1-9 reference images and check their order.\n2. Describe the shot in ordinary language.\n3. Choose 9:16 or 2:3; keep Standard and 5 seconds initially.\n4. Choose lora_1 from your shared library and its recommended strength_1. Leave lora_2 at (none) unless stacking a second compatible H3 LoRA. (none) applies no LoRA.\n5. Run. Ollama sees all images, writes the prompt, unloads, then H3 applies ONLY your selections and renders.\nAdd future downloads in config/lora_links.txt in GitHub, one link per line. All links download in both templates.\nCivitai trigger words are included automatically for selected LoRAs. Add any missing HF triggers in extra_trigger_words.\nNo OmniNode, RefMod, reference-text grammar or manual prompt copying."
      ]
    }
